OL,3,GNEWSABridge reopening delayed as
OL,4,Afurther damage found
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe reopening of a bridge will be
OL,7,Fdelayed after further damage was found
OL,8,Fto the structure.
OL,10,FRepair work to the former railway
OL,11,Fbridge at Cumwhinton, near Carlisle,
OL,12,Fstarted in September, but Cumberland
OL,13,FCouncil maintenance teams then
OL,14,Fidentified issues with the bridge
OL,15,Fparapet.
OL,17,FPart of the B6263 road is due to reopen
OL,18,Fby 23 October, subject to weather and
OL,19,Fsite conditions, with closures from
OL,20,F09:00 BST to 15:30 on weekdays, the
OL,21,Fcouncil said.
OL,23,APub: 09-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB NW Eng NewsC Reg TVF Weather
